# Default: normalize line endings to LF for anything text-ish going forward, so a
# CRLF-saving editor (or Windows checkout settings) can't quietly turn a one-line
# change into a "187 insertions / 187 deletions" diff again - this project already
# hit that once with notification-service/ai-service.
* text=auto eol=lf

/gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
